                     <br/>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Compare<br/>to MiraLAX®<br/>active<br/>ingredient*</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Mix-In</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Laxative <br/>Packets</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Polyethylene Glycol 3350<br/>Powder for Solution<br/>Osmotic Laxative</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Relieves occasional<br/>  constipation<br/>  (irregularity)<br/>• Softens stool<br/>• Dissolves in any<br/>  beverage</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">10 PACKETS<br/>NET WT 0.5 OZ<br/>(17 g) EACH</content>
